                    "text": "How to verify your CMI receipt at the desk: Look at the top center of the thermal paper slip printed by the terminal. It must explicitly read 'PRE-AUTORISATION'. If the slip reads 'VENTE' or 'ACHAT', the agency has physically debited your bank account rather than placing a temporary hold."
