        "summaryDirectAnswer": "In Morocco, Basic CDW (Collision Damage Waiver) caps your financial liability at a high excess (franchise) between 10,000 MAD (€920) and 30,000 MAD (€2,750), frozen on your credit card. True Zero Excess (Franchise Zéro / SCDW) eliminates this deductible for 120 to 250 MAD (€11–€23) per day, reducing your security deposit to 0–3,000 MAD. Beware: third-party broker insurance still requires leaving the full deposit at the rental desk.",
