                    "text": "In the EVENT OF A MINOR COLLISION inside Casablanca with zero bodily injury, DO NOT move the vehicles before completing a joint Constat Amiable d'Accident (European-style carbon paper accident report found in your glovebox) or summoning the Constatier Mobile insurance surveyor. Moving your vehicle prematurely destroys topological fault evidence, voiding your collision waiver and leaving you liable for the full repair value."
