                "answer": "Multinational franchises in Terminal P1 (Avis, Hertz, Sixt, Europcar) strictly reject debit cards (including Revolut, Wise, and Monzo) unless you purchase their in-house counter insurance at 250–320 MAD/day (€23–€29/day). However, vetted independent agencies operating out of AGA Parking P2 accept Visa/Mastercard debit cards and modest refundable cash deposits ranging from 3,000 to 5,000 MAD (€275–€460), or 0 MAD deposit when booking with comprehensive SCDW coverage."
